---
description: Present feasible portfolios, dependencies, tradeoffs and vote boundaries to the community.
args: { dossier: BudgetDossier; change: PortfolioChange; portfolios: CivicPortfolio[]; feasibility: ProposalFeasibility[]; workGraph: PortfolioLedger }
returns: BudgetDecisionPacket
---
Show exact portfolio totals, shared enabling work, constraints, unresolved assessments, proposer review status and tradeoffs under the published rules. Do not state or imply a vote result. If a selected project changes during delivery, retain its original selection and attach a separate scope-change item with its governing community-approval rule.
